{
  "$comment": [
    "Cover manifest for the YominUnreal plugin suite.",
    "Colours were measured off the original Photoshop covers in raw/ (the frame",
    "gradient from the canvas edges, the title fill and stroke from the glyph",
    "bands). The title fill always equals frameTop; titleStroke is the",
    "per-plugin contrast colour.",
    "Each alternative headline carries its OWN background screenshot and crop,",
    "matching the Photoshop originals: the gallery image that says 'User-friendly",
    "GUI' shows a different capture than the one that says 'One chat'. The",
    "correspondence was recovered by correlating each original cover's frame",
    "interior (upper half only - the lower band is covered by the headline and",
    "the scrim) against every candidate capture, then checked by eye.",
    "One command renders everything:  python tools/cover/generate.py"
  ],
  "root": "../..",
  "output": "docs/public/covers",
